\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2 's RBI -5: Traders Say  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Still Needed \b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Februar 1996\par 14:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Traders said that although the package is likely to give a small boost to the rupee in early trading Thursday, more aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank will still be needed to decisively turn the rupee around. \par \par \uc2  'There should be some change in sentiment, at least for a while,' said Ravi Pai, chief dealer at HDFC Bank Ltd. in Bombay. \par \par \uc2  He added, however, that 'the measures will have to be supplemented by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . If they are not supplemented, I'm not sure they'll be very effective.' \par \par \uc2  Dealers noted that Wednesday's technical moves are generally of a long-term nature, and won't bring a big shift in the balance between the supply and demand of dollars immediately. \par \par \uc2  And while they could help to restore some confidence in the rupee for the short-term, that confidence could be lost if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't follow up by aggressively selling dollars to boost the Indian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'The rupee will appreciate sharply only if some there is some concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' by the RBI, a dealer at a European bank said. \par \par \uc2  Traders generally predicted that the rupee would open slightly higher Thursday at between 36.75 rupees and 37.25 rupees, versus 37.30 rupees at the end of trading Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  But they said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be needed to push the dollar down further to 36.00 rupees, and warned that the dollar could even rebound if \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action isn't forthcoming. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-02-96 \par \par \uc2  1341GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds27015bz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
