\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Rupee Weakens Further Despite RBI  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 306 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Februar 1996\par 12:49\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW DELHI (AP-DJ)--The Indian rupee weakened further Thursday despite significant \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) as heavy demand for dollars pushed the Indian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to close near an all-time low hit Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 36.61 rupees Thursday, after opening at 36.45 rupees, despite the RBI hammering the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  all the way down from 36.65 rupees to around 36.50 rupees in early trading. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that there was strong demand for dollars, with most of the dollar buying coming from companies. \par \par \uc2  'Its mostly commercial demand that's driving it (the dollar) up now,' a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader with a European bank said, noting that some companies seem to have panicked. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not budging the dollar much, the dollar could blow-out to 37.50 (rupees) soon, if massive amounts (of dollars) aren't pumped in,' he said. \par \par \uc2  The RBI's effort to keep the dollar from flaring was not very successful despite fairly large sales of dollars for rupees, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader with a U.S. bank said, noting that the sentiment on the rupee was 'extremely bearish.' \par \par \uc2  A spokeswoman for the RBI confirmed the dollar sales, but as usual declined to comment on the amounts or levels at which it sold. \par \par \uc2  Traders noted that the bearishness has been induced by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's failure to stem the rise in the dollar past key levels like 35.00 rupees and 36.00 rupees, despite continuing \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'It (the RBI) lets go of key levels very easily,' another \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader with a foreign bank said, adding that the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't been well timed to prevent tests of key levels. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 01-02-96 \par \par \uc2  1149GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2100zdi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
