\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2 's RBI says  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market. \b0\par\par\uc2 122 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Januar 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, Jan 25 (Reuter) - The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI), the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said it was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday afternoon by selling dollars to support the sagging rupee. \par \par \uc2  The RBI official did not give the quantum of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the rupee was holding firm at 35.93/96 per dollar despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  after opening steady at 35.83/85. \par \par \uc2  They said strong month-end demand for dollars and a long weekend ahead pushed the rupee down to 35.96/99 when the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  halted the slide. \par \par \uc2  The markets are closed on Friday for India's Republic Day. \par \par \uc2  -- Bombay newsroom +91-22-285 2851 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds1p0428c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
