\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Rupee Gains On RBI  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 , Long Liquidation \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Januar 1996\par 12:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW DELHI (AP-DJ)--The Indian rupee rose against the dollar in moderate trading Tuesday, supported by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) and some dollar sales by commercial banks. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that the dollar opened around 35.84 rupees, but then dropped in early trading on \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders who dealt with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it sold relatively large lots of $5 million at levels between 35.81 rupees and 35.83 rupees. \par \par \uc2  A spokeswoman for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  later confirmed that it had sold dollars for rupees, but as usual declined to provide details such as the levels or amounts. \par \par \uc2  But after that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said the dollar continued to fall on its own, as some banks trimmed long positions amid a lack of corporate demand. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon trading, the dollar was quoted at 34.7650 rupees, down from 35.8450 rupees Monday. \par \par \uc2  'The RBI sold in the morning. Thereafter the selloff was more on account of banks liquidating long positions,' a trader at a foreign bank in Bombay said. \par \par \uc2  Traders noted that a three-day weekend starting Friday made some players shy away from getting stuck with long positions. And at the same time, a holiday in Calcutta Tuesday helped to limit dollar demand, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the State Bank of India, the biggest player in the local market, are located in Calcutta. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 23-01-96 \par \par \uc2  1141GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds1n00qle\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
