\par\par \b \uc2  Indian Rupee At 2-Month Low Despite RBI  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Dezember 1995\par 12:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW DELHI (AP-DJ)--The Indian rupee fell to a two-month low against the dollar Wednesday, although \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) helped the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rebound from its weakest levels of the day. \par \par \uc2  Traders noted that dollar buying from a major state bank that often handles big orders from importers lifted the dollar early Wednesday, pushing it well beyond the key 35.00-rupee level that the RBI had been eyeing in recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  But the RBI finally stepped in just before midday to stop the rupee's slide, selling dollars to several banks at levels between 35.08 rupees and 35.10 rupees, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the sales pushed the dollar back from a peak around 35.11 rupees - its highest level since the end of October - and left the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  around 35.06 rupees late in the day, versus 35.005 rupees late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  A spokeswoman for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but declined to elaborate on the amounts of dollars sold or the levels at which it traded. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the move to allow the dollar to move more significantly past the 35.00-rupee level confirmed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seems content to allow a small amount of rupee depreciation each day, rather than stick by a cap of 35.00 rupees. \par \par \uc2  'They do have a moving target,' said Ravi Pai, chief dealer at HDFC Bank Ltd. in Bombay. 'The 35.00 (rupee) level was something that was meant to be a temporary thing,' he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 27-12-95 \par \par \uc2  1141GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drcr0abeq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
