\par\par \b \uc2  Indian Rupee Weakens Slightly Despite RBI Dlr Sales \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Dezember 1995\par 12:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW DELHI (AP-DJ)--The Indian rupee weakened slightly against the dollar Thursday, despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In relatively active trading, dealers noted that dollar buying from a major state bank that often acts on behalf of big importers pushed the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  higher early in the day. \par \par \uc2  But although dollar sales by the RBI around 34.95 rupees capped the climb, they weren't large enough to push the dollar back down, traders said. \par \par \uc2  At 1120 GMT, the dollar was trading at 34.95 rupees, up from 34.93 rupees late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  A spokesman for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed that the bank sold dollars for rupees 'in a small way' Thursday, but declined to comment further on the amounts sold or the levels at which it acted. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't had a big impact,' a trader that dealt with the bank said. He noted that the RBI was ready to sell small amounts of dollars around the 34.95-96 rupee level, but never came aggressively to the market with big orders. \par \par \uc2  At the same time, though, dealers said the RBI action was enough to prevent a rise in the dollar above 35.00 rupees, which the RBI appears to be fixing as a ceiling for the time being. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-12-95 \par \par \uc2  1135GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drce09ykj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict