\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2 's RBI will  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  as needed - governor. \b0\par\par\uc2 191 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Dezember 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NEW DELHI, Dec 5 (Reuter) - Reserve Bank of India (RBI) Governor C. Rangarajan reiterated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when needed to make sure fluctuations in the value of the rupee are consistent with economic fundamentals. \par \par \uc2  "The Reserve Bank of India will continue to keep a close watch on developments in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as necessary to make sure that market fluctuations are contained within reasonable limits and are consistent with the economic fundamentals," he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor said the recent decline in the value of the rupee against the U.S. dollar became necessary because of a drop-off in foreign capital inflows and the appreciation of the dollar against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when a "bandwagon effect" led to excessive downward pressure on the rupee, he told the Federation of Chambers of Commerce and Industry (FICCI). \par \par \uc2  Consequently, he said, the rupee has remained stable at below 35 to the dollar for the past five weeks and the forward premium has started coming down, he said. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drc501126\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
