\par\par \b \uc2  India Economic Officials Bail Out Ailing Rupee: Amplifier \b0\par\par\uc2  By TIMOTHY MAPES \par \uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Oktober 1995\par 15:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW DELHI (AP-DJ)--The Indian government finally drew the line on a recent slide in the rupee against the dollar, as key officials stepped in an apparently coordinated effort to talk up the rupee and backed it up by more forceful \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and other measures from the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  After watching the rupee tumble about 12% over the past two months, officials set the stage for a rupee rebound over the weekend as Commerce Secretary P. Chidambaram told an unusual Sunday press conference that he felt the rupee had fallen too far and should rally. \par \par \uc2  Those sentiments were echoed in a strongly-worded statement from Reserve Bank Gov. C. Rangarajan on Monday, who described the rupee's recent weakness as a short-term disequilibrium that 'must get reversed.' \par \par \uc2  To that end, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  later announced moves it said were aimed at increasing supplies of and limiting demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the domestic market. \par \par \uc2  And the RBI also launched another round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday to support the rupee, a spokeswoman for the bank confirmed. Though she wouldn't elaborate on the bank's activities, traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  took the unprecedented step of selling dollars in the forward markets as well as in the spot market. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-10-95 \par \par \uc2  1416GMT \par \par \uc2  1134 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drau08gnr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
