\par\par \b \uc2  Indian Rupee/Weakens -3: Forward Dlr Premium Up, Seen Higher \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Oktober 1995\par 14:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The demand for forward dollars went up, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at a U.S. bank said, with the six-month premium on forward dollars rising to 1.56 rupees, from a premium of 1.48 rupees Tuesday. She said the continuing demand could boost the premiums further over the next week. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the chief executive of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Dealers Association of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , V. Ananthakrishnan, said Wednesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 'very good.' He said it was the 'correct step' as a 'runaway depreciation of the rupee should not be allowed.' \par \par \uc2  He said that because the RBI has stopped quoting official buying and selling rates, it should have a specific \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate and should step in occasionally to prevent exaggerated moves in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'This was only a warning, they have to keep an eye on the market,' he said. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile overnight inter-bank call money rates stayed between 13.5%-14.5%, with money market traders expecting no change this week. Rates were stable as no major outflows or inflows were reported in the banking system, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  However, money market rates were expected to go up next week due to national holidays Monday and Wednesday, traders said, though they were expected to stay within the range of 13%-17%. \par \par \uc2  'I don't expect rates to rise beyond 17% next week,' a money market dealer in a U.S. bank said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 18-10-95 \par \par \uc2  1214GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drai082x5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
