\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  RBI  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to arrest rupee's fall vs dlr. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Shyam Kumar \par \uc2 543 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Oktober 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, Oct 16 (Reuter) - The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Monday interevened to prevent the rupee from falling to a low of 35 rupees per dollar, reassuring worried importers and encouraging exporters to sell the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "It is the first time they have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to push up the rupee," said a dealer with a private bank. "Until now, we've heard about \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  only through state-run banks." \par \par \uc2  "They had to send a signal to the market," said a dealer at a state-run bank, referring to panic among importers rushing for forward cover at high premia after the rupee showed signs of continuing weakness over the last few weeks. \par \par \uc2  "The market was moving in one way only -- importers panicking and exporters postponing sale of dollars hoping that the rupee would fall further," he said. \par \par \uc2  The premia on forward dollars touched a high of 9.0 percent annualised from around 7.0 percent last month, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  An RBI official confirmed reports that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars at around 34.0/34.15 level to arrest the fall of rupee which had touched a low of 34.90, threatening to touch the 35.0 rupees per dollar level. She declined to elaborate further. \par \par \uc2  Analysts had predicted in September that the rupee would continue its downhill slide, weakened by a strong growth in imports coupled with lower foreign investments this year. \par \par \uc2  "Too much depreciation can make imports expensive and push up inflation, and RBI doesn't want that," said a dealer. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the rupee opened at 34.20/25 on Monday and steadily weakened to touch a low of 34.95. \par \par \uc2  "At that level, there was some profit-booking, and the rupee moved marginally up to 34.90," said a dealer. \par \par \uc2  "All of a sudden, the dollar crashed to 34.0 and the rupee held on at that level for some time," said another dealer. \par \par \uc2  After the RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the rupee weakened again to the 34.60/90 level showing genuine demand from corporates for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "It doesn't mean the RBI move was unsuccessful," said a dealer. "But for their \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the rupee would have fallen below the 35 level," he said. \par \par \uc2  "Last time, it was fear and speculative pressure," said a dealer, explaining the rupee's fall to 35.0 per dollar in end-September. \par \par \uc2  "This time it is genuine corporate cover," she said. "It is even more dangerous." \par \par \uc2  When the rupee plunged to an all-time low of 35 to the dollar in September, RBI did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  recovered marginally to settle around the 34.0 per dollar level. \par \par \uc2  Dealers and even exporters appreciated the RBI action. "It is good they have shown some initiative," said the treasury manager of a steel company. \par \par \uc2  He said Indian corporates were not educated enough to cope with such volatility in the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  "If they don't smoothen the market, who else will?" asked another dealer. "Last time they left it to market forces and were rapped by the press," he said, referring to the fall of rupee against the dollar in end-September. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drag02xzy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
