\par\par \b \uc2  India's Reserve Bank/Rupee -2: Slowing Of Funds Into India \b0\par\par\uc2 108 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 04:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW DELHI (AP-DJ)--The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stopped \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to prevent the rupee from appreciating because a slowdown of funds coming into the country has taken the upward pressure off the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the chairman of India's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in an interview published Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  However, the interview in the Business Standard newspaper didn't make clear whether the Reserve Bank would refrain from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  if upward pressure on the rupee returns, and bank officials weren't immediately available for comment. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 28-02-95 \par \par \uc2  0342GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3101ggb\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (india near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \c